#10341
statue Diabolist cage~
the statue~
A marble statue of a dark Diabolist stands here.
~
This Diabolist is carved from the finest of marbles.  The artist seems to have
caught the vitality of his subject, so much so that the statue seems alive.
~
4195395 4194944&256 1000 C
50 0 -212 4d50+1805 3d5+40
100 0
112 112 1
13 13 13 13 13 13 0
0 0 0 0 0
85 7 0 0 1 1 0
0 0 3 0 3072 0 0 0
> act_prog p looks at you.~
if class($n) == Diabolist
mpechoat $n Hello $n, I am a fellow Diabolist who is here to tell you a little
mpechoat $n about the Monk class.  For instance, our prime stat is Intelligence.
cast 'dragon wit' $n
mpechoat $n That spell will raise your int for a while, the spell is
mpechoat $n called Dragons Wit.  To find out all the spells, skills, weapon types
mpechoat $n and languages available to you, type 'slist'.  To see additional
mpechoat $n information on the Diabolist class, type 'help diabolist'.
mpechoat $n I can also help you PRACtice your diabolist skills.
mpechoat $n Good luck $n!
if level($n) == 1
or level($n) == 2
or level($n) == 3
mpechoat $n I have a gift for you, say the word 'bestow' to receive it...
endif
endif
~
> act_prog p bounces around.~
mpforce $n look
mpecho The statue begins to move, marble transforming to flesh.
emote looks at you.
smile $n
mpecho The statue once again returns to its solid marble form.
~
> speech_prog bestow~
if class($n) == Diabolist
if level($n) == 1
or level($n) == 2
mpoload 10320 1
mpoload 10330 1
mpoload 10330 1
mpoload 10331 1
put potion bag
put potion bag
put escape bag
give bag $n
mpechoat $n To use the potions, type 'quaff potion' or 'quaff elixir'.
mpechoat $n To use the scroll, type 'recite scroll'.
mpechoat $n Type 'exam bag' to see what is inside, and 'get <item> bag' or
mpechoat $n 'put <item> bag' to get and remove items.
mpechoat $n Use these items wisely, as they may save your life...
mpforce $n config +brief
mpforce $n wake
mpforce $n down
mpat $n mpforce $n config -brief
else
smile $n
mpechoat $n You are too high a level to need my assistance now.
