> act_prog p looks at you.~
if class($n) == Mage
mpechoat $n Hello $n, I am a fellow mage who is here to tell you a little
mpechoat $n about the mage class. For instance, our prime stat is intelligence.
cast 'dragon wit' $n
mpechoat $n That spell will raise your int for a while, the spell is
mpechoat $n called dragon wit. To find out all the spells, skills, weapon
mpechoat $n types and languages available to you, type SLIST. To find out
mpechoat $n information on the mage class, type HELP MAGE.
mpechoat $n I can also help you PRACtice your mage skills.
mpechoat $n Good luck $n!
if level($n) == 1
or level($n) == 2
or level($n) == 3
mpechoat $n I have a gift for you, type SAY BESTOW to receive it.
endif
endif
~
> speech_prog bestow~
if class($n) == Mage
if level($n) == 1
or level($n) == 2
mpoload 10320 1
mpoload 10330 1
mpoload 10330 1
mpoload 10331 1
put potion bag
put potion bag
put scroll bag
give bag $n
mpechoat $n To use the potions, type QUAFF POTION or QUAFF ELIXIR.
mpechoat $n To use the scroll, type RECITE SCROLL.
mpechoat $n Type exam bag to see what is inside, and get <item> bag or
mpechoat $n put <item> bag to get and remove items.
mpechoat $n Use these items wisely, as they may save your life.
mpforce $n config +brief
mpforce $n wake
mpforce $n down
mpat $n mpforce $n config -brief
else
smile $n
mpechoat $n You are too high a level to need my assistance now.
endif
endif
~
