cast 'slink' $n
mpechoat $n That spell will raise your dexterity for a while, the spell is
mpechoat $n called Slink.  To find out all the spells, skills, weapon types
mpechoat $n and languages available to you, type 'slist'.  To see additional
mpechoat $n information on the Monk class, type 'help monk'.
mpechoat $n I can also help you PRACtice your monk skills.
mpechoat $n Good luck $n!
if level($n) == 1
or level($n) == 2
or level($n) == 3
