#10355
The Room Of Portals~
This is the portal room which leads to the training hall for each of the
classes.  Prepare to be transferred once your presence is noticed.  It may
take a few moments, so please be patient.  Should you decide you are not
ready to face the Chamber of Trials, you can return to the south.  You
notice a large certificate on the wall; at least you have something
to read while you wait.
~
0 3146764 0 0 0 0
D2
The University Healer
~
~
0 -1 10319 0
E
certificate wall~
I have enjoyed writing the revision of the Darkhaven University. I wanted
the new players armed with as much information as possible before venturing
into the open game. Take your time here, learning the commands and seeing
how the programs on the mobs and items work. It will help you later in your
travels. If you have trouble understanding anything you find in the University,
type WHO 51 and ask an immortal for assistance. I wish you well in your
adventuring. May you enjoy many hours of joy and develop many friendships.

                     Warm Huggles,
                     Brittany Seccunda-DethBlayde
                     February 9, 1996

** Please be sure to read HELP RULES STAKE prior to engaging in fighting.
** Staking a mob is illegal, as is stealing a kill.

Added to the bottom in a messy scrawl is the following:
Modified by Drazuk to become the University of Alden   6/17/2004
~
> speech_prog p temporarily out of order~
if class ($r) == Mage
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Mages portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Mages Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10323
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Cleric
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Clerics portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Clerics Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10324
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Warrior
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Warriors portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Warriors Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10318
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Thug
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Thugs portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Thugs Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10321
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Druid
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Druids portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Druids Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10320
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Ranger
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Rangers portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Rangers Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10391
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
if class ($r) == Thief
  mpechoat $r The ground opens beneath you!  You drop into the Thieves portal.
  mpechoat $r You land in the Thieves Hall with a bounce.
  mptransfer $r 10322
  mpat $r mpforce $r bounce
endif
~
|
S
#10356
A Stone Corridor~
This is the stage of your training where you may begin to feel pangs of
hunger and a parched throat. In other words, you need food and drink.
To the east is the University Supply Store. You may purchase water and
some meat. Once you have eaten and drunk, you will be ready to proceed
north.
~
